                  "text": "AMS 6370"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Alloy Steel Grade: AISI 4130"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Product Forms: Steel, Bars, Forgings, and Rings"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Scope: This specification covers an aircraft-quality, low-alloy steel in the form of bars, forgings, flash welded rings, and stock for forging or flash welded rings."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Product availability:"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[Alloy Steel Grade AISI 4130 Round Bar](https://qqa.titanium.com/product/mill-product-alloy-steel-round-bar)"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "DISCLAIMER: The use of this information should be considered strictly voluntary. Information contained in this page or across the domain, may contain typographical errors and are for reference only. Information presented are purely generalizations and are not a substitution for AMS specifications."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "DISCLAIMER: Alloy data sheets are for reference only, not for design purposes."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Chemical Composition"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Fe 97.0%"
                },
