                  "text": "P 0.05%"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Mechanical Properties"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Tensile Strength: 81.2 – 150 ksi"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Yield Strength: 52.3 – 63.3 ksi"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Elongation: 25.5 – 28.2%"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Tensile properties and associated requirements vary due to orientation, section thickness, and engineering requirements."
